                  <span class="article-toc__text">What everyone wanted to see</span>
                </a>

                <a
                  href="#back-in-the-workshop"
                  class="article-toc__link"
                  data-toc-link="back-in-the-workshop"
                >
                  <span class="article-toc__number">02</span>
                  <span class="article-toc__text">Back in the workshop</span>
                </a>

                <a
                  href="#missed-us"
                  class="article-toc__link"
                  data-toc-link="missed-us"
                >
                  <span class="article-toc__number">03</span>
                  <span class="article-toc__text">Missed us in Guangzhou?</span>
                </a>
              </nav>

            </div>
          </aside>


          <!-- 正文 -->
          <article class="news-detail__content">

            <!-- Lead -->
            <p class="article-lead">
              This October, we packed up our best samples and flew to
              Guangzhou for the 138th Canton Fair.
            </p>

            <p>
              Our booth was busy from day one. We shook hands with over
              <strong>200 corporate buyers</strong>, brand owners, and event
              planners from more than <strong>30 countries</strong> — the US,
              Europe, the Middle East, Southeast Asia, you name it.
            </p>


