                October 2025 · Our booth at the 138th Canton Fair
              </figcaption>
            </figure>


            <p>
              People came to touch and test our products. One buyer from
              Germany spent a good ten minutes flipping our challenge coin,
              feeling the deep relief and the antique brass finish.
            </p>


            <!-- 客户原声 -->
            <blockquote class="article-quote">
              "This is solid."
            </blockquote>


            <p>
              Another from Singapore asked if she could take our enamel pin
              outside to see how the glitter sparkled in sunlight. Those
              little moments told us more than any online meeting ever could.
            </p>


            <!-- 01 -->
            <section
              id="what-everyone-wanted"
              class="article-section"
              data-article-section="what-everyone-wanted"
            >
              <h2>What everyone wanted to see</h2>

              <p>
                We brought hundreds of samples, but four types stole the show:
              </p>

              <p>
                <strong>3D challenge coins</strong> — heavy, with sharp edges
                and a vintage look. Great for military units, anniversaries,
                or collector sets.
              </p>

              <p>
                <strong>Special enamel pins</strong> — we used transparent
                enamel over textured metal, plus tiny glitter and fine printed
                lines. They look classic but fresh.
              </p>

              <p>
                <strong>Marathon medals with moving parts</strong> — sports
                organisers loved the spinning centre pieces and cutout shapes.
                We also paired them with custom printed lanyards.
              </p>

              <p>
                <strong>Soft PVC keychains</strong> — flexible, lead-free,
                and safe for kids. Brands that do giveaways and youth merch
                grabbed samples right away.
              </p>

              <p>
                All our materials meet <strong>RoHS and REACH</strong>, so
                you don't have to worry about regulations.
              </p>
            </section>


            <!-- 02 -->
            <section
              id="back-in-the-workshop"
              class="article-section"
              data-article-section="back-in-the-workshop"
            >
              <h2>Back in the workshop</h2>

              <p>
                The fair is over, but we haven't stopped. Right now our mold
                team is cutting dies for projects that started at the show.
              </p>

              <p>
                We've also tweaked our polishing and plating schedules so we
                can turn orders around faster — especially for Q4 and early
                spring 2026 deliveries. And our art team is helping a few
                customers polish their rough sketches into print-ready files.
                If you left a drawing with us, we're already on it.
              </p>
            </section>


            <!-- 03 -->
            <section
              id="missed-us"
              class="article-section"
              data-article-section="missed-us"
            >
              <h2>Missed us in Guangzhou? No worries.</h2>

              <p>
                You can still see our full collection — no waiting required.
                <a
                  href="/download/metalcrafts-catalog.pptx"
                  download
                  class="article-download"
                >Download</a>
                our latest catalog and browse every product line, material spec,
                and finish at your own pace.
              </p>

              <p>
                Prefer to feel it in your hands? We can also mail you a free
                sample kit, so you can check the weight, texture, and finish
                yourself. We ship worldwide.
              </p>

              <p>
                And if you have nothing but an idea — even a scribble —
                email our engineering team at
                <a href="mailto:daniel.imaginef@gmail.com">
                  daniel.imaginef@gmail.com
                </a>.
                We'll turn it into a real product. No jargon, no hassle.
                Just honest making.
              </p>

              <p class="article-ending">
                We make things that people actually enjoy holding.
              </p>
            </section>

          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Related -->
    {relatedNews.length > 0 && (
      <section class="news-detail__related">
        <div class="news-detail__container">

          <div class="news-detail__related-header">
            <p class="news-detail__related-eyebrow">MORE FROM METALCRAFTS</p>

            <a href="/news" class="news-detail__related-all">
              All News <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="news-detail__related-list">
            {relatedNews.map((item, index) => (
              <a
                href={`/news/${item.slug}`}
                class="news-detail__related-item"
              >
                <span class="news-detail__related-index" aria-hidden="true">
                  {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
                </span>

                <div class="news-detail__related-media">
                  <Image
                    src={item.cover}
                    alt={item.alt}
                    loading="lazy"
                    widths={[300, 450, 600]}
                    sizes="180px"
                  />
                </div>

                <div class="news-detail__related-body">
                  <div class="news-detail__related-meta">
                    <time datetime={toNewsISO(item.date)}>
                      {formatNewsDate(item.date)}
                    </time>

                    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>

                    <span>CM CRAFTS</span>
                  </div>

                  <h2 class="news-detail__related-title">{item.title}</h2>
                </div>

                <span class="news-detail__related-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                  ↗
                </span>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>
    )}

  </main>
</BaseLayout>


<!-- TOC 交互 -->
<script>
  type NewsWindow = Window & {
    __metalNewsDetailCleanup?: () => void;
  };

  function initNewsDetail() {
    const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".news-detail");
    const nav = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".nav");
    const toc = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".article-toc");

    const tocLinks = Array.from(
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>("[data-toc-link]")
    );

    const sections = Array.from(
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-article-section]")
    );

    if (!root || !nav || !toc || !tocLinks.length || !sections.length) return;

    const win = window as NewsWindow;
    win.__metalNewsDetailCleanup?.();

    const syncNavHeight = () => {
      root.style.setProperty(
        "--nav-height",
        `${nav.getBoundingClientRect().height}px`
      );
    };

    const setActive = (id: string) => {
      tocLinks.forEach((link) => {
        const isActive = link.dataset.tocLink === id;
        link.classList.toggle("is-active", isActive);

        if (isActive) {
          link.setAttribute("aria-current", "location");
        } else {
          link.removeAttribute("aria-current");
        }
      });
    };

    const handleLinkClick = (event: MouseEvent) => {
      const link = event.currentTarget as HTMLAnchorElement;
      const id = link.dataset.tocLink;
      if (!id) return;

      const target = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!target) return;

      event.preventDefault();

      const navHeight = nav.getBoundingClientRect().height;
      const targetTop =
        target.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.scrollY - navHeight - 28;

      window.scrollTo({ top: targetTop, behavior: "smooth" });

      history.replaceState(null, "", `#${id}`);
      setActive(id);
    };

    tocLinks.forEach((link) => {
      link.addEventListener("click", handleLinkClick);
    });

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        const visible = entries
          .filter((entry) => entry.isIntersecting)
          .sort(
            (a, b) => a.boundingClientRect.top - b.boundingClientRect.top
          );

        if (!visible.length) return;

        const activeId = (visible[0].target as HTMLElement).dataset
          .articleSection;

        if (activeId) setActive(activeId);
      },
      {
        root: null,
        rootMargin: `-${nav.getBoundingClientRect().height + 48}px 0px -62% 0px`,
        threshold: 0,
      }
    );

    sections.forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));

    syncNavHeight();

    const resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(() => syncNavHeight());
    resizeObserver.observe(nav);

    const handleResize = () => syncNavHeight();
    window.addEventListener("resize", handleResize);

    const hash = window.location.hash.replace("#", "");
    if (hash && sections.some((section) => section.id === hash)) {
      setActive(hash);
    } else {
      setActive(sections[0]?.id ?? "");
    }

    win.__metalNewsDetailCleanup = () => {
      tocLinks.forEach((link) => {
        link.removeEventListener("click", handleLinkClick);
      });
      observer.disconnect();
      resizeObserver.disconnect();
      window.removeEventListener("resize", handleResize);
      win.__metalNewsDetailCleanup = undefined;
    };
  }

  initNewsDetail();
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initNewsDetail);
</script>


<style>
/* ============================================================
   FONT — 试装阶段，确定后改自托管
   注意：这次补上了 700 字重，正文加粗才真的有对比
   ============================================================ */
@import url(
  "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,400italic;8..60,500;8..60,500italic;8..60,600;8..60,700&display=swap"
);


/* ============================================================
   PAGE TOKENS
   ============================================================ */
.news-detail {
  --paper: #f6f3ec;
  --paper-soft: #fbfaf7;

  --ink: #1b1a18;
  --ink-strong: #0d0c0b;
  --muted: #706b63;
  --muted-soft: #8b8479;

  --line: #ded9cf;
  --line-soft: #e8e3da;

  --gold: #ae8d5a;

  --font-serif: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;

  background: var(--paper);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}

.news-detail *,
.news-detail *::before,
.news-detail *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.news-detail__container {
  width: min(1380px, 94vw);
  margin: 0 auto;
}


/* ============================================================
   HERO
   ============================================================ */
.news-detail__hero {
  padding: calc(var(--nav-height, 72px) + 76px) 0 96px;
}

.news-detail__hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: clamp(56px, 6vw, 82px);
  align-items: center;
  width: min(1240px, 100%);
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.news-detail__hero-copy {
  max-width: 670px;
}

.news-detail__hero-kicker {
  margin: 0 0 22px;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.news-detail__title {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(40px, 4.6vw, 66px);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.02;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
}

.news-detail__excerpt {
  max-width: 610px;
  margin: 28px 0 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.62;
}

.news-detail__meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  color: var(--muted-soft);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.news-detail__hero-media {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
  background: var(--paper-soft);
}

.news-detail__hero-media img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.8s ease;
}

.news-detail__hero-media:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.012);
}


/* ============================================================
   ARTICLE LAYOUT — TOC 弹性宽 200~260 + 900 正文，整体居中
   ============================================================ */
.news-detail__body {
  padding: calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--hero-gap)) 0 112px;
}

.news-detail__reading-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 260px) 900px;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: clamp(56px, 6vw, 82px);
  width: min(1240px, 100%);
  margin: 0 auto;
  align-items: start;
}


/* ============================================================
   TOC
   ============================================================ */
.article-toc {
  position: sticky;
  top: calc(var(--nav-height, 72px) + 36px);
  align-self: start;
  padding-top: 4px;
}

.article-toc__label {
  margin-bottom: 22px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.article-toc__nav {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  gap: 1px;
}

.article-toc__nav::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 1px;
  background: var(--line-soft);
}

.article-toc__link {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 12px 0 12px 18px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 0.25s ease, padding-left 0.25s ease;
}

.article-toc__number {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  opacity: 0.85;
  transition: color 0.25s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
}

.article-toc__text {
  min-width: 0;
}

.article-toc__link:hover {
  color: var(--ink);
  padding-left: 18px;
}

.article-toc__link.is-active {
  color: var(--ink);
  padding-left: 18px;
}

.article-toc__link.is-active::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
}

.article-toc__link.is-active .article-toc__number {
  color: var(--gold);
  opacity: 1;
}


/* ============================================================
   CONTENT — 正文
   ============================================================ */
.news-detail__content {
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.72;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.news-detail__content p {
  margin: 0 0 26px;
}

.news-detail__content h2 {
  scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 24px);
}


/* Lead */
.article-lead {
  margin-bottom: 30px !important;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 25px;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: -0.005em;
}


/* Quotes */
.article-quote {
  margin: 40px 0;
  padding: 0 0 0 24px;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 18px;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.article-quote + .article-quote {
  margin-top: 30px;
}


/* Sections */
.article-section {
  scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 24px);
}

.article-section + .article-section {
  margin-top: 76px;
}

.article-section h2 {
  margin: 0 0 25px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 36px);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.022em;
}

.article-section h2::after {
  content: "";
  display: block;
  width: 34px;
  height: 1px;
  margin-top: 18px;
  background: var(--gold);
}


/* Panorama */
.article-panorama {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 68px 0 76px;
}

.article-panorama img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

.article-panorama figcaption {
  margin-top: 12px;
  color: var(--muted-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}


/* Inline */
/* —— 加粗加强：700 字重 + 更深的墨色，在 19px 正文里跳得出来 —— */
.news-detail__content strong {
  color: var(--ink-strong);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.news-detail__content a {
  color: var(--gold);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
  transition: color 0.2s ease;
}

.news-detail__content a:hover {
  color: var(--ink);
}


/* Download link — 带文件图标的小按钮，和正文链接区分开 */
/* Download link — 圆角胶囊按钮，与正文基线对齐 */
.article-download {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 2px 11px 3px;
  margin: 0 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--gold) !important;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  line-height: 1;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-decoration: none !important;
  white-space: nowrap;
  vertical-align: 0.15em;   /* ← 关键：微抬，跟正文基线对齐 */
  transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}

.article-download::after {
  content: "↓";
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1;
}

.article-download:hover {
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--paper) !important;
}


/* Ending */
.article-ending {
  margin-top: 48px !important;
  padding-top: 30px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-size: 22px;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.55;
}


